{"id":"memorial_102801","cat":"memorial","group":{"id":"memorial102800","label":"Data · Rapture Anomaly Report - Part 2"},"label":"Rapture Anomaly Report 06","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"memorial_102802","speakers":{},"icons":{},"lines":[{"id":"memorial_102801_1","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_28_01_description","text":"After feasting, the Rapture stood up, seemingly rejuvenated."},{"id":"memorial_102801_2","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_28_01_description","text":"This defies all common sense. I must have a screw loose."},{"id":"memorial_102801_3","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_28_01_description","text":"I'm probably just seeing things."},{"id":"memorial_102801_4","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_28_01_description","text":"Is that a Commander and some Nikkes coming this way? They must be a mirage as well."},{"id":"memorial_102801_5","type":"Speech","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_Memorial:memorial_28_01_description","text":"There's no way my distress signal actually made it through."}]}